/**
 * Alias for {@link RcEncryptionNonce}.
 *
 * `Nonce` is a convenience alias used in contexts where the full name
 * `RcEncryptionNonce` is verbose or where the nonce is used generically
 * (e.g. in the Poseidon commitment function which accepts any protocol nonce).
 *
 * @remarks
 * The two types are identical at the structural level. Use whichever name is
 * clearer in context; they are interchangeable everywhere in the SDK.
 *
 * @public
