 * @remarks
 * This is the characteristic of the finite field GF(p) over which all
 * Rescue-XLIX arithmetic is performed. It was chosen by Bernstein for
 * Curve25519 because it admits fast modular reduction on 64-bit hardware
 * (only a subtraction of a small constant is needed after a shift).
